  <reason>Subject and account: The subject of this report is Hira Farooq, holder of account PK**MEZN****5135, opened on 25 December 2017. The customer's declared occupation is medical sales officer (salaried), with a declared income of PKR 150,000 per month.

Activity summary: During the period 3 March 2026 to 25 March 2026, the account recorded 11 credits totalling PKR 16,928,000 as well as 4 debits totalling PKR 15,639,000. The credits included 10 cash deposits totalling PKR 16,778,000, made over the counter at 3 branches (Clifton Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch, Saddar Branch). The activity was detected on 25 March 2026, when Tazama typology STR-PK-01 scored 320 against an alert threshold of 300.

Grounds for suspicion: 8 of 10 cash deposits (80%) were between PKR 1,600,000 and PKR 1,999,999, totalling PKR 14,922,000, just below the cash transaction reporting threshold of PKR 2,000,000. The cash was deposited across 3 branches (Clifton Branch, Gulshan-e-Iqbal Branch, Saddar Branch) rather than at a single branch. The customer made more than one cash deposit on 1 day (20 March 2026). Credits in the activity window were 112.9 times the declared monthly income, against a declared income of PKR 150,000 per month. A note by Branch Operations (15 March 2026): "Customer asked why deposits of PKR 2 million or more need extra paperwork and declined to explain the source of the cash." Taken together, these indicators are consistent with suspected structuring; the reporting entity has not established the underlying offence.

Flow of funds: Of the outgoing funds, PKR 15,639,000 was sent to Sheraz Traders (PK**SHER****1518, Synthetic Bank B) in 4 transactions. Funds did not remain in the account: debits equal to 92% of credits, with a median of 14.9 hours between the latest credit and each debit.

Other considerations: Screening of the subject returned no match on sanctions, PEP or adverse-media screening on 29 March 2026.

Action taken by the reporting entity: Action taken: a note by L2 analyst (29 March 2026): "Account placed under enhanced monitoring pending the reporting decision. No contact made with the customer about this review."</reason>
